{
  "sn22.135:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 22.135 ",
  "sn22.135:0.2": "13. Avijjāvagga ",
  "sn22.135:0.3": "Tatiyakoṭṭhikasutta ",
  "sn22.135:1.1": "Taññeva nidānaṁ. ",
  "sn22.135:1.2": "Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho āyasmā sāriputto āyasmantaṁ mahākoṭṭhikaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn22.135:1.3": "“‘avijjā, avijjā’ti, āvuso koṭṭhika, vuccati. ",
  "sn22.135:1.4": "Katamā nu kho, āvuso, avijjā; ",
  "sn22.135:1.5": "kittāvatā ca avijjāgato hotī”ti? ",
  "sn22.135:2.1": "“Idhāvuso, assutavā puthujjano rūpaṁ nappajānāti, rūpasamudayaṁ nappajānāti, rūpanirodhaṁ nappajānāti, rūpanirodhagāminiṁ paṭipadaṁ nappajānāti. ",
  "sn22.135:2.2": "Vedanaṁ nappajānāti …pe… ",
  "sn22.135:2.3": "saññaṁ … ",
  "sn22.135:2.4": "saṅkhāre … ",
  "sn22.135:2.5": "viññāṇaṁ nappajānāti, viññāṇasamudayaṁ nappajānāti, viññāṇanirodhaṁ nappajānāti, viññāṇanirodhagāminiṁ paṭipadaṁ nappajānāti. ",
  "sn22.135:2.6": "Ayaṁ vuccatāvuso, avijjā; ",
  "sn22.135:2.7": "ettāvatā ca avijjāgato hotī”ti. ",
  "sn22.135:3.1": "Evaṁ vutte, āyasmā sāriputto āyasmantaṁ mahākoṭṭhikaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn22.135:3.2": "“‘vijjā, vijjā’ti, āvuso koṭṭhika, vuccati. ",
  "sn22.135:3.3": "Katamā nu kho, āvuso, vijjā; ",
  "sn22.135:3.4": "kittāvatā ca vijjāgato hotī”ti? ",
  "sn22.135:4.1": "“Idhāvuso, sutavā ariyasāvako rūpaṁ pajānāti, rūpasamudayaṁ pajānāti, rūpanirodhaṁ pajān